  _motive: From the recording of the conversation, it was heard that someone helped
    the Lisa to make the poison. It also seems from talking to her that she had a
    problem with the performer at the way he handled himself.
  _means: She had the way to make the poison written down and had many ways to get
    her hands on some chemicals to make the poison.
  _opportunity: She said that she was checking through her list but then later admitted
    that she was on the phone. Which means she was close to the performers room and
    had the chance to sprinkle in the poison before the drink got to the performer.
